    "archive SHA-256 matches the value here, and keeps it in a per-user cache. Nothing here",
    "is a project dependency. A version moves only by editing this file deliberately.",
    "Asset digests are the ones the upstream GitHub release publishes for that asset.",
    "deadcode and govulncheck install with go install, which the Go checksum database verifies.",
    "opengrep-rules is the LGPL community rule set; a Git commit id pins its content."
